---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import AssessmentList from "../components/AssessmentList";
---

<Base title="Smart Market Watchlist">
  <main style="max-width: 52rem; margin: 2rem auto; padding: 0 1rem; font-family: system-ui, sans-serif;">
    <h1>Smart Market Watchlist</h1>
    <p>
      <strong>Steps 0–2.</strong> Three source families travel one path: exchange
      disclosures, market observations, and news → adapter → evidence → extraction →
      grounding → event candidate → linking → corroboration → the Meaningful Change
      Engine → persisted assessment → this page.
    </p>
    <p style="font-size: 0.9em;">
      Deliberately unstyled. Corroboration counts independent publishers, not articles:
      several reports of one story become one event, and repetition by a single outlet
      does not become confirmation. No user state yet, so this is everything the system
      knows rather than what changed since you last looked.
    </p>
    <hr />
    <AssessmentList client:load />
  </main>
</Base>
